SUMMARY:Walder Education Lev & Learning: Mindy Blumenfeld\, LCSW\, on Traum
 a and Children's Behavior
LOCATION:Walder Education\, Skokie
DESCRIPTION:Join Walder Education's Lev & Learning series for an evening wi
 th Mindy Blumenfeld\, LCSW\, exploring how trauma impacts children's behav
 ior\, relationships\, and emotional growth. Register at waldereducation.or
 g/lev.\n\nSource text: "Join Walder Education’s Lev & Learning series fo
 r an evening with Mindy Blumenfeld\, LCSW\, exploring how trauma impacts c
 hildren’s behavior\, relationships\, and emotional growth. Through a war
 m\, practical\, and Torah-rooted approach\, Mindy will share compassionate
  strategies to help parents and educators better understand and support ch
 ildren with resilience\, connection\, and sensitivity. The program takes p
 lace June 2nd at Walder Education in Skokie."
CATEGORIES:event
END:VEVENT
